From 99277872bdc1495453458493affed7111307c825 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexey Immoreev <github@luixo.me>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:48:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mozilla: remove stale generated certificates before
 conversion

certdata2pem.py does not remove obsolete files and creates a _2 variant
when a certificate output name already exists. Clear previous generated
output before invoking the converter.

Signed-off-by: Alexey Immoreev <github@luixo.me>
---
 mozilla/Makefile | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/mozilla/Makefile
+++ b/mozilla/Makefile
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@
 #
 
 all:
+	rm -f -- *.crt
 	python3 certdata2pem.py
 
 clean:
